    Player: '32-card Poker (French Poker) is draw poker using a 32-card stripped deck (7-A). 2-5 players. 5 cards each. Blinds, betting, draw up to 4, final betting, showdown. Key difference: Flush BEATS Full House (flushes are rarer). A can be low (A-7-8-9-10 straight valid). Suit ranking may break ties: ♥>♦>♣>♠.',
